      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Hospitalized children's drawings show that the hospital is perceived from little patients as a huge and often terrific reality, in spite of the efforts made by nurses and doctor in order to soften the experience of hospedalization. There's a need of a change in hospital's structures in order to make them closer to children' word of experience and to give him/her more security and tranquilisation in everyday hospital life."},
